{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00001", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00001", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "排气筒设置合规性", "question": "两个排气筒高度分别为24m和30m，距离为50m，排放速率分别为0.44kg/h和2.56kg/h。是否需要按等效排气筒考虑？等效排气筒的排放速率和等效高度分别是多少？", "answer": "需要按等效排气筒考虑（50<24+30=54）。\n等效排放速率 Q = 0.44+2.56 = 3.0 kg/h\n等效高度 H = sqrt((24^2+30^2)/2) = sqrt(738) = 27.2m", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 16297-1996", "standard_name": "大气污染物综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "answer_terms": ["等效排气筒", "排放速率", "均方根"], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准公式计算"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["calculation_accuracy", "standard_knowledge"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00002", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00002", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "排气筒设置合规性", "question": "两个排气筒高度均为25m，距离为40m，等效排气筒的高度是多少？", "answer": "H = sqrt((25^2+25^2)/2) = sqrt(625) = 25m\n两个等高排气筒的等效高度即为原高度。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 16297-1996", "standard_name": "大气污染物综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准公式计算"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "simple", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L1_fact", "evaluation_dimensions": ["calculation_accuracy"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00003", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00003", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "排气筒设置合规性", "question": "两个排放二甲苯的排气筒，高度均为20m，间距25m，排放速率分别为0.6kg/h和0.8kg/h。等效排气筒的高度和排放速率是多少？", "answer": "等效排放速率 Q = 0.6+0.8 = 1.4 kg/h\n等效高度 H = sqrt((20^2+20^2)/2) = 20m\n需对照GB 16297-1996中20m排气筒的排放速率限值判断是否达标。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 16297-1996", "standard_name": "大气污染物综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准公式计算"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["calculation_accuracy", "standard_knowledge"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00004", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00004", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "排气筒设置合规性", "question": "某企业有两根排放二甲苯的排气筒，a高15m、排放速率3.1kg/h，b高25m、排放速率4.8kg/h，间距35m。是否需要等效？等效排气筒的排放速率、等效高度和位置分别是什么？", "answer": "需等效。间距35m < 15+25=40m。\n等效排放速率 Q = 3.1+4.8 = 7.9 kg/h\n等效高度 H = sqrt((15^2+25^2)/2) = sqrt(425) = 20.6m\n等效位置（距a的距离）：x = 35 x 4.8 / 7.9 = 21.3m", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 16297-1996", "standard_name": "大气污染物综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准公式计算"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "hard", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L3_application", "evaluation_dimensions": ["calculation_accuracy", "step_completeness"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00005", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00005", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "汽车涂装车间扩建项目", "industry_code": "C361", "industry_name": "汽车制造", "project_type": "扩建", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "排放速率计算", "question": "某汽车涂装车间烘干室，废气量2.1x10^4 m3/h，甲苯浓度86mg/m3，采用直接燃烧法处理，净化效率96.5%，计算甲苯排放速率（kg/h）。", "answer": "甲苯排放速率 = 86 x 2.1x10^4 x (1-0.965) x 10^-6\n= 86 x 21000 x 0.035 x 10^-6\n= 0.063 kg/h\n\n关键步骤：先算处理前总排放量，再乘以(1-净化效率)得处理后排放速率。注意单位换算：1kg=10^6mg。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 16297-1996", "standard_name": "大气污染物综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准公式计算"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["calculation_accuracy", "unit_conversion"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00006", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00006", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "热电厂改扩建项目", "industry_code": "D441", "industry_name": "电力生产", "project_type": "改扩建", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "SO2排放量计算", "question": "某热电厂新建2x670t/h煤粉炉，年运行5500h，煤含硫0.9%，湿式石灰石石膏脱硫效率90%，SO2排放浓度200mg/Nm3，烟气量424.6Nm3/s。计算全厂SO2年排放量（t/a）。", "answer": "全厂SO2年排放量 = 424.6 x 200 x 5500 x 3600 x 10^-9\n= 424.6 x 200 x 5500 x 3600 / 10^9\n= 1681.4 t/a\n\n注意单位换算：1t=10^9mg，3600s/h，5500h/a。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 13223-2011", "standard_name": "火电厂大气污染物排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准公式计算"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["calculation_accuracy", "unit_conversion"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00007", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00007", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "排放量计算", "question": "某企业年烧柴油200t、重油300t，柴油燃烧排放系数1.2万m3/t，重油1.5万m3/t，废气年排放量为多少万m3？", "answer": "废气年排放量 = 200x1.2 + 300x1.5 = 240 + 450 = 690万m3。", "standards_normalized": [], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "排放系数法计算"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "simple", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L1_fact", "evaluation_dimensions": ["calculation_accuracy"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00008", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00008", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "垃圾焚烧发电项目", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "新建", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "焚烧炉排放达标分析", "question": "某垃圾焚烧炉，含硫率0.06%，硫转化率80%，石灰石脱硫效率80%，年运行8000h，实际烟气量1.024x10^5 Nm3/h，垃圾处理量24t/h。计算SO2排放浓度（mg/Nm3）并与GB 18485标准限值对比判断是否达标。", "answer": "SO2排放浓度 = 1000 x 0.06% x 0.8 x 0.8 x 64/32 / 24 / 1.024x10^5 x 10^9\n= 1000 x 0.0006 x 0.8 x 0.8 x 2 / 24 / 102400 x 10^9\n= 0.768 x 2 / 24 / 102400 x 10^9\n= 312.5 mg/Nm3\n\nGB 18485规定SO2限值为260mg/Nm3。312.5 > 260，不达标。需提高脱硫效率或采取其他措施。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 18485-2014", "standard_name": "生活垃圾焚烧污染控制标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准公式+限值对比"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "hard", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L3_application", "evaluation_dimensions": ["calculation_accuracy", "standard_knowledge", "compliance_judgment"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00009", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00009", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "大气评价等级判定", "question": "某项目排放两种大气污染物：A的最大地面浓度占标率PA=15%，D10%A=1.2km；B的PB=10%，D10%B=1.1km。根据HJ 2.2-2018，该项目的大气环境评价等级是什么？", "answer": "Pmax = max(15%, 10%) = 15% >= 10%\n检查一级条件：需要Pmax >= 10% 且 D10% >= 5km\nD10% = 1.2km < 5km，不满足一级条件\nPmax >= 10%，不满足三级(Pmax<10%)\n因此评价等级为二级。\n\nHJ 2.2-2018判据：Pmax>=10%时，D10%>=5km为一级，否则为二级。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "HJ 2.2-2018", "standard_name": "环境影响评价技术导则 大气环境", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "导则标准判定"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["standard_knowledge", "step_logic"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_CALC_00010", "pair_id": "exam_calc_00010", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "大气评价等级判定", "question": "某项目排放污染物Pmax=30%，D10%=0.8km且在厂界内。根据HJ 2.2-2018，评价等级和评价范围边长分别是多少？", "answer": "Pmax=30%>=10%，但D10%=0.8km<5km且在厂界内。\n当D10%在厂界内时，评价范围边长=2xD10%=1.6km。\nD10%在厂界内且<5km，判定为三级。\n答案：三级，评价范围边长1.6km。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "HJ 2.2-2018", "standard_name": "环境影响评价技术导则 大气环境", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "导则标准判定"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "calculation", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["standard_knowledge", "boundary_judgment"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_REASON_00001", "pair_id": "exam_reason_00001", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "汽车涂装车间项目", "industry_code": "C361", "industry_name": "汽车制造", "project_type": "扩建", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废水", "review_point": "第一类污染物排放控制", "question": "某汽车涂装车间废水含总镍、总锌。项目拟将涂装废水送入厂区综合污水处理站处理。这个方案是否可行？为什么？", "answer": "不可行。总镍属于第一类污染物。\n根据GB 8978-1996，第一类污染物必须在车间排放口或车间处理设施排放口达标，不得送入综合污水处理站混合稀释。\n\n正确做法：含镍废水在车间内单独收集、预处理达标后再与其他废水合并处理。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 8978-1996", "standard_name": "污水综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准明确规定的第一类污染物控制要求"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废水", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "reasoning", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["standard_knowledge", "compliance_judgment"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_REASON_00002", "pair_id": "exam_reason_00002", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废水", "review_point": "第一类污染物识别", "question": "电镀车间废水含总铬、六价铬、总镍、总铜、总锌、氰化物。哪些属于第一类污染物？第一类污染物的排放控制有什么特殊要求？", "answer": "第一类污染物：总铬、六价铬、总镍、氰化物。\n总铜、总锌属于第二类污染物。\n\n控制要求：\n1. 必须在车间或车间处理设施排放口采样监测\n2. 排放浓度须达相应标准限值\n3. 不得稀释排放，不得送入综合污水处理站\n4. 含不同第一类污染物的废水应分类收集处理", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 8978-1996", "standard_name": "污水综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准明确规定的分类要求"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废水", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "reasoning", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["standard_knowledge", "classification_accuracy"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_REASON_00003", "pair_id": "exam_reason_00003", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "C292", "industry_name": "塑料制品制造", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "标准适用性判断", "question": "某塑料制品项目产生注塑废气，报告同时引用GB 31572-2015和DB44/27-2001。这两个标准如何选择适用？", "answer": "1. 有行业标准优先执行行业标准。塑料制品属合成树脂工业下游，优先执行GB 31572-2015\n2. 地方标准可严于国家标准，相同项目执行较严值\n3. GB 31572-2015未规定的项目，补充执行DB44/27-2001\n4. 若项目明确属合成树脂工业，以GB 31572-2015为主要执行标准", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 31572-2015", "standard_name": "合成树脂工业污染物排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}, {"standard_code": "DB44/27-2001", "standard_name": "大气污染物排放限值", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准适用原则"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "reasoning", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["standard_knowledge", "professionalism"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_REASON_00004", "pair_id": "exam_reason_00004", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "印刷行业", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "标准适用性判断", "question": "某印刷项目VOCs排放，可用标准有GB 41616-2022和DB44/815-2010。应优先执行哪个？理由是什么？", "answer": "应优先执行GB 41616-2022。\n理由：\n1. GB 41616-2022是印刷工业国家行业标准，2022年发布，较DB44/815-2010更新\n2. 行业标准优先于综合标准\n3. DB44/815-2010中更严格的项目按较严值执行\n4. GB 41616-2022未覆盖的污染物补充执行DB44/815-2010", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 41616-2022", "standard_name": "印刷工业大气污染物排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}, {"standard_code": "DB44/815-2010", "standard_name": "印刷行业挥发性有机化合物排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "标准适用原则+时效性分析"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "reasoning", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["standard_knowledge", "version_awareness"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_REASON_00005", "pair_id": "exam_reason_00005", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "治理措施可行性", "question": "某污水处理厂污泥干化项目产生恶臭气体（H2S、NH3），报告提出采用单一水洗法处理。是否可行？为什么？", "answer": "单一水洗法不可行。\n原因：\n1. H2S和NH3虽部分溶于水，但溶解度有限，单一水洗难达排放标准\n2. 恶臭气体含多种有机硫化物，部分有机物难溶于水，水洗无法有效去除\n3. 可行方案：水洗+生物处理/光催化氧化/活性炭吸附联合处理", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 14554-1993", "standard_name": "恶臭污染物排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "工艺可行性分析+标准要求"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "reasoning", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["professionalism", "feasibility_judgment"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_REASON_00006", "pair_id": "exam_reason_00006", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "", "industry_code": "", "industry_name": "", "project_type": "", "report_type": "考试真题", "element": "废气", "review_point": "治理措施可行性", "question": "汽车涂装车间喷漆废气含漆雾和VOCs，常用的漆雾净化方法有哪些？分别适用于什么场景？", "answer": "1. 活性炭吸附法：适用于低浓度小风量有机废气，效率90-98%，活性炭需定期更换\n2. 水膜喷淋吸收法：去除漆雾颗粒物效果好，对VOCs去除有限，通常作预处理\n3. 静电净化法：适用于微细漆雾，压损小，不适用于易燃易爆场所\n\n实际工程常用[水喷淋预处理+活性炭吸附/催化燃烧]组合工艺。", "standards_normalized": [], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "medium", "reason": "工程经验总结"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气", "difficulty": "medium", "question_type": "reasoning", "cognitive_level": "L2_analysis", "evaluation_dimensions": ["professionalism", "completeness"]}, "quality_score": 90, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
{"qa_id": "EXAM_COMP_00001", "pair_id": "exam_comp_00001", "level": "国家级", "region": "", "company": "", "project_name": "汽车涂装车间扩建项目", "industry_code": "C361", "industry_name": "汽车制造", "project_type": "扩建", "report_type": "考试真题（案例分析）", "element": "废气+废水+固废", "review_point": "综合判断与多要素分析", "question": "某汽车制造厂扩建涂漆车间。已知：\n[1] 喷漆室废气量8.6x10^4 m3/h，漆雾浓度680mg/m3，含甲苯12mg/m3，由30m排气筒排放\n[2] 两个烘干室废气量均为2.1x10^4 m3/h，甲苯浓度86mg/m3，采用直接燃烧法净化效率96.5%，分别由30m排气筒排放，相距50m\n[3] 涂漆废水含总镍、总锌\n\n请分步回答：\n(1) 喷漆室可采用的漆雾净化方法？\n(2) 计算各烘干室甲苯排放速率及两排气筒等效高度\n(3) 废水送综合污水处理站是否可行？\n(4) 哪些属于危险废物？", "answer": "## (1) 漆雾净化方法\n活性炭吸附、水膜喷淋吸收、静电净化\n\n## (2) 计算\n甲苯排放速率 = 86 x 21000 x (1-0.965) x 10^-6 = 0.063 kg/h\n两排气筒相距50m，h1+h2=60m，50<60需等效\n等效高度 H = sqrt((30^2+30^2)/2) = 30m\n\n## (3) 废水方案\n不可行。总镍是第一类污染物，须在车间排放口达标。\n\n## (4) 危险废物\n漆渣、含镍污水站污泥属于危险废物。", "standards_normalized": [{"standard_code": "GB 16297-1996", "standard_name": "大气污染物综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}, {"standard_code": "GB 8978-1996", "standard_name": "污水综合排放标准", "source": "exam_answer"}], "approval_evidence": [], "report_evidence": [], "evidence_alignment": {"level": "high", "reason": "多步推理链"}, "benchmark_metadata": {"task_domain": "废气+废水+固废", "difficulty": "hard", "question_type": "comprehensive", "cognitive_level": "L3_application", "evaluation_dimensions": ["step_completeness", "cross_element_integration", "standard_knowledge"]}, "quality_score": 95, "quality_issues": [], "need_human_review": false}
